herdr-app-mods

This project contains modified copies of files from Herdr (https://herdr.dev),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The original files were
created with `herdr-app do mod.clone` and `herdr-app do layout.clone` from
Herdr 0.1.18.

Changes:

- mods/agents-title/main.js (from Herdr's `agents` mod)
  - Default sort is "Grouped by space" instead of "Priority".
  - In grouped view, agents within a space sort by status rank, then by
    latest status change.
  - In priority/pinned rows, the agent's title leads and the space name
    follows, dimmed.
  - Agents on machines listed in shared("machines.folded") are hidden,
    except pinned agents and agents whose status is blocked.
  - The working spinner turns every 2000 ms instead of 900 ms.

- mods/spaces-fold/main.js (from Herdr's `spaces` mod)
  - Publishes the folded machines to shared("machines.folded") on start
    and whenever a machine is folded or unfolded.

- layouts/my-main.json (from Herdr's `main` layout)
  - Uses the `agents-title` and `spaces-fold` mods and the `ghostty` theme.

The remaining files (themes/ghostty.json, settings.example.json, install.sh,
README.md) are original to this project. themes/ghostty.json reproduces
Ghostty's default color palette.
